OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning for most with
OL,6,Fspells of drizzly showers, although
OL,7,Fsome dry periods. Winds, light and
OL,8,Fvariable yet feeling a touch cooler
OL,9,Fthan yesterday before things turn even
OL,10,Fchillier on Wednesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPersistent rain overnight
OL,13,Fturning heavy at times, moving off
OL,14,Fsteadily south and eastwards.
OL,15,FTemperatures a touch lower compared to
OL,16,Flast nights in a gentle northerly
OL,17,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
