OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FNoticeably chillier on
OL,6,FWednesday, with cloud and rain around
OL,7,Fto start, brightening up by the
OL,8,Fafternoon with a few light showers
OL,9,Fpossible. A gentle northerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,12,FThursday a dry, sunny, but chilly
OL,13,Fstart, before cloud and rain moves in
OL,14,Fovernight. Feeling milder Friday, with
OL,15,Frain clearing to showers behind,
OL,16,Fcontinuing into Saturday with sunny
OL,17,Fintervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
